OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner launches water
OL,4,Aregulation legal challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaigner has launched a legal
OL,7,Fchallenge against the Environment
OL,8,FAgency (EA), accusing it of failing to
OL,9,Fenforce its bathing water regulations.
OL,11,FIn a judicial review claim, Nicola
OL,12,FHayden argues the EA has failed to
OL,13,Fcarry out its legal duties to prevent
OL,14,Fthe pollution of bathing sites on the
OL,15,FRomney Marsh coast in Kent, including
OL,16,Fat the Littlestone and Dymchurch
OL,17,Fbeaches which have a "poor" water
OL,18,Fquality rating.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
